# Overall Refactoring Plan

## Goal Description
Refactor the codebase to improve maintainability, reduce redundancy, and prevent future import errors. Key focus areas are removing redundant re-exports in [mangaCore.js](file:///c:/Users/hirak/Desktop/%E6%BC%AB%E7%94%BB/src/utils/manga/mangaCore.js), splitting logic in [useMangaState.js](file:///c:/Users/hirak/Desktop/%E6%BC%AB%E7%94%BB/src/hooks/useMangaState.js), and consolidating utility functions.

## User Review Required
No major UI changes, but verifying the application still runs correctly after refactoring is critical.

## Proposed Changes

### 1. Simplify `utils/manga/`
#### [DELETE] [src/utils/manga/mangaCore.js](file:///c:/Users/hirak/Desktop/%E6%BC%AB%E7%94%BB/src/utils/manga/mangaCore.js)
- This file purely re-exports functions from `gridUtils` and `textUtils`.
- **Action**: Delete this file and update all consumers to import directly from [gridUtils.js](file:///c:/Users/hirak/Desktop/%E6%BC%AB%E7%94%BB/src/utils/manga/gridUtils.js) or [textUtils.js](file:///c:/Users/hirak/Desktop/%E6%BC%AB%E7%94%BB/src/utils/text/textUtils.js).

#### [MODIFY] [src/utils/manga/layoutGenerator.js](file:///c:/Users/hirak/Desktop/%E6%BC%AB%E7%94%BB/src/utils/manga/layoutGenerator.js)
- Update imports to remove dependency on [mangaCore.js](file:///c:/Users/hirak/Desktop/%E6%BC%AB%E7%94%BB/src/utils/manga/mangaCore.js).

### 2. Refactor State Management (`hooks/`)
#### [NEW] [src/hooks/usePersistence.js](file:///c:/Users/hirak/Desktop/%E6%BC%AB%E7%94%BB/src/hooks/usePersistence.js)
